   "body": "### Early close drops last streamed event\n\n**Medium Severity**\n\n<!-- DESCRIPTION START -->\n`_finish_stream` now runs on `GeneratorExit`, but `_process_response_item` still runs after `yield`. Closing or breaking after an event leaves that event out of `complete_response`, so the exported span misses the last delivered `id`, usage, and content. A `next()`-then-`close()` path records nothing at all.\n<!-- DESCRIPTION END -->\n\n<!-- BUGBOT_BUG_ID: 92a0e833-a16a-4ab2-b354-c620f4ca06b1 -->\n\n<!-- LOCATIONS START\nsrc/lmnr/opentelemetry_lib/opentelemetry/instrumentation/anthropic/streaming.py#L211-L219\nsrc/lmnr/opentelemetry_lib/opentelemetry/instrumentation/anthropic/streaming.py#L231-L239\nLOCATIONS END -->\n<details>\n<summary>Additional Locations (1)</summary>\n\n- [`src/lmnr/opentelemetry_lib/opentelemetry/instrumentation/anthropic/streaming.py#L231-L239`](https://github.com/lmnr-ai/lmnr-python/blob/cb96227c6e57c393d4ea69d45bb5753cd3454be4/src/lmnr/opentelemetry_lib/opentelemetry/instrumentation/anthropic/streaming.py#L231-L239)\n\n</details>\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/open?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Cursor\" width=\"115\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Fix in Web\" width=\"99\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/fix-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a></div>\n\